# Copy to terraform.tfvars ONLY to override a default. Every variable already
# defaults to the live tmprl-demo.cloud environment (see variables.tf), so the
# normal case is no terraform.tfvars file at all. Real terraform.tfvars is
# gitignored; this .example is committed.

